DECISION_VERSION 1.0.0

ID DECISION-0003

STATUS APPROVED

DATE 2026-07-27

DECIDED_BY President Cley Duarte

TITLE

Adopt a versioning and release-cadence policy: SemVer on the engine line,
batch releases by default, and reserve 1.0.0 as a stability commitment.

RAW_TEXT

Estas de acuerdo con el versionado no te parece que es muy alto -> De
acuerdo (record a versioning policy + batch features / publish less
frequently from now on).

CONTEXT

Prompted by the President noticing four releases in one afternoon
(0.2.0 -> 0.4.0) and asking whether the version was climbing too fast.

CONSEQUENCES

From now on PACE batches features and publishes deliberately, not per
feature. Full policy in policies/VERSIONING_POLICY_0.1.0.pdl. Enforced as
RULE-0009.

END
